   "ruling": "Ruling: equivalent representation; project retained after BUG-0002. The first row of each section reads “At least $100,000 but not over …” (i1040gi, 2025 Tax Computation Worksheet, Sections A–D); the project encodes both bounds, the second transcription only the upper one, because the worksheet is entered only for amounts of $100,000 or more (the table-or-worksheet switch in `tax_on_amount`). Within that switch the two agree. Every other row, and the per-status parameters, agree exactly once the project's upper bounds were corrected to inclusive (BUG-0002, BUG_INVENTORY.md): before that fix this comparison showed the strict bounds the text does not have."
